      "message": "Why not set dev.bootcomplete  here \u0026 not have `trigger boot` from init? It kinda makes sense letting microdroid_manager declare bootcomplete \u003d 1. \n\n\nFor ex, the code above `if let Some(mut child) \u003d encryptedstore_child xxxx` needs to happen before dev.bootcomplete is set true because it relies on uneventd which is stopped after boot.complete ......",
