      "side": 0,
      "message": "We need to wait for the init to finish the boot sequence (e.g. post-fs-data action) before running a payload, otherwise we might start a payload before authfs_service was started, hence I used the dev.bootcomplete property. In doing so I\u0027ve introduced a race condition for encrypted storage :(, sorry about that!\n\nI think we can either:\n\n1. Introduce a way for init to notify microdroid_manager that it\u0027s done with the boot sequence (another sysprop?)\n2. Make microdroid_manager responsible for stopping ueventd.",
